            "detailed_description": "You are the GUNNVR, controlling a United Dynamics prototype remote upgradable turret on an Earth Defence Force shuttle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntelligence has sent you to check out a large field of asteroids that has mysteriously appeared in Earth's orbit. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you break up the rocks in time to save the civilians?<br />\r\nDo you have the resolve to track down why this happened?<br />\r\nWill you get rich destroying hostile enemy ships?<br />\r\nAre you going to fly something better than a Defence Force shuttle?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you have the courage, you will find the answers in this spaceship turret control game for the HTC Vive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote: All settings and progress you make in the free demo will be saved to your Steam Cloud and automatically loaded into purchased Early Access and final retail versions.",
            "about_the_game": "You are the GUNNVR, controlling a United Dynamics prototype remote upgradable turret on an Earth Defence Force shuttle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntelligence has sent you to check out a large field of asteroids that has mysteriously appeared in Earth's orbit. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you break up the rocks in time to save the civilians?<br />\r\nDo you have the resolve to track down why this happened?<br />\r\nWill you get rich destroying hostile enemy ships?<br />\r\nAre you going to fly something better than a Defence Force shuttle?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you have the courage, you will find the answers in this spaceship turret control game for the HTC Vive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote: All settings and progress you make in the free demo will be saved to your Steam Cloud and automatically loaded into purchased Early Access and final retail versions.",
